    "text": "<p>Adding surfactants in non polar solvent, the micelles structure will look like</p><p>(a)</p><p><img src=\"assets\\qt0015_1e8a30f4a98c.png\" style=\"width: 200px; height: 200px;\" /></p><p>(b)</p><p><img src=\"assets\\qt0015_b214f87e3e37.png\" style=\"width: 200px; height: 200px;\" /></p><p>(c)</p><p><img src=\"assets\\qt0015_b248f6eb0202.png\" style=\"width: 200px; height: 201px;\" /></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>(d)</p><p><img src=\"assets\\qt0015_12a647798ac1.png\" style=\"width: 200px; height: 201px;\" /></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;</p>"
